  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Refugee Response Programme 2023-2026 (Transcend Project )</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the Transcend programme is to increase community awareness and health-seeking behaviour for essential healthcare services; Improve access and utilization of quality healthcare services; Strengthen the institutional capacity of county health systems to manage healthcare; and Enhance Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Adapting Learning (MERL) in Turkana County.

The implementing partner is the Africa Medical Research Foundation (AMREF).</narrative>
  </description>
